    "title": "New blood test offers alternative for colorectal cancer screening - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Gabby Womack ,\n6 hours ago CHARLOTTESVILLE, Va. (WVIR) - Colonoscopies are no longer the only way doctors can screen for colorectal cancer. Dr. Andrew Wolf, a physician and professor at UVA’s School of Medicine, said new guidelines are opening the door to more screening options as more young adults are being diagnosed with colorectal cancer. New blood tests are now available. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
